chezmoi dots lint — Check registries and rendered templates

USAGE
  chezmoi dots lint [<check>...]

ARGUMENTS
  check  registry, aliases, packages, secrets, matrix, templates (default: all checks).
  Checks are arguments, not subcommands; supplied order and repetitions are preserved.

OPTIONS
  -h, --help  Show this help and exit successfully.

ENVIRONMENT
  CHEZMOI_EXECUTABLE  chezmoi executable (default: chezmoi).
  CHEZMOI_CONFIG_FILE  chezmoi config file (default: chezmoi's config).
  CHEZMOI_SOURCE_DIR  source directory (default: ask chezmoi; honors .chezmoiroot).

EXAMPLES
  chezmoi dots lint
  chezmoi dots lint registry templates
